{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"css-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"CSS Snippets","description":"Layouts, grid, flexbox, animations, variables and responsive helpers.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"CSS","path":"snippets/css.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/css.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Flex center\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"display: flex;\",\n      \"align-items: center;\",\n      \"justify-content: center;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Center with flexbox\"\n  },\n  \"Flex row\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"display: flex;\",\n      \"gap: ${1:1rem};\",\n      \"align-items: ${2:center};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A flex row\"\n  },\n  \"Grid columns\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"grid\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"display: grid;\",\n      \"grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(${1:240px}, 1fr));\",\n      \"gap: ${2:1rem};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A responsive grid\"\n  },\n  \"Media query\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@media (min-width: ${1:768px}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A media query\"\n  },\n  \"Dark mode\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dark\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Respect the dark setting\"\n  },\n  \"Custom properties\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"vars\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \":root {\",\n      \"\\t--${1:color}: ${2:#0a84ff};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"CSS variables\"\n  },\n  \"Keyframes\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"kf\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@keyframes ${1:name} {\",\n      \"\\tfrom { $2 }\",\n      \"\\tto { $3 }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An animation\"\n  },\n  \"Transition\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"transition: ${1:all} ${2:0.2s} ${3:ease};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A transition\"\n  },\n  \"Absolute fill\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fill\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"position: absolute;\",\n      \"inset: 0;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Fill the parent\"\n  },\n  \"Truncate text\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"trunc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"overflow: hidden;\",\n      \"text-overflow: ellipsis;\",\n      \"white-space: nowrap;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"One line with an ellipsis\"\n  },\n  \"Visually hidden\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"position: absolute;\",\n      \"width: 1px;\",\n      \"height: 1px;\",\n      \"overflow: hidden;\",\n      \"clip: rect(0 0 0 0);\",\n      \"white-space: nowrap;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Hide but keep for screen readers\"\n  },\n  \"Reset\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"reset\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\",\n      \"body { margin: 0; }\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A small reset\"\n  },\n  \"Aspect ratio\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ar\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"aspect-ratio: ${1:16 / 9};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A fixed aspect ratio\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# CSS Snippets\n\nLayouts, grid, flexbox, animations, variables and responsive helpers.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 13 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| CSS | `fc` | Center with flexbox |\n| CSS | `fr` | A flex row |\n| CSS | `grid` | A responsive grid |\n| CSS | `mq` | A media query |\n| CSS | `dark` | Respect the dark setting |\n| CSS | `vars` | CSS variables |\n| CSS | `kf` | An animation |\n| CSS | `tr` | A transition |\n| CSS | `fill` | Fill the parent |\n| CSS | `trunc` | One line with an ellipsis |\n| CSS | `sr` | Hide but keep for screen readers |\n| CSS | `reset` | A small reset |\n| CSS | `ar` | A fixed aspect ratio |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}